# Original fictional watershed-monitoring corpus for operational trials.
requirement OPS-SECURE-001
title: Protect monitoring operations
statement:
  The monitoring service shall protect operator actions and monitoring data from unauthorized use or alteration.
rationale:
  False observations or unauthorized commands could cause unsafe public decisions.
end requirement

requirement SYS-SECURE-AUTHN-001
title: Authenticate actors and stations
statement:
  The service shall authenticate each operator, gateway, and station before accepting protected interactions.
decomposes: OPS-SECURE-001
end requirement

requirement ID-OPERATOR-001
title: Authenticate operators
statement:
  The identity service shall authenticate each operator using two configured authentication factors.
decomposes: SYS-SECURE-AUTHN-001
end requirement

requirement ID-STATION-001
title: Authenticate stations
statement:
  The gateway shall authenticate each station using a station-specific credential.
decomposes: SYS-SECURE-AUTHN-001
end requirement

requirement SYS-SECURE-AUTHZ-001
title: Authorize protected actions
statement:
  The service shall permit a protected action only when the authenticated actor holds its configured role.
decomposes: OPS-SECURE-001
end requirement

requirement ACCESS-ROLE-001
title: Enforce operator roles
statement:
  The access service shall evaluate the operator role before changing thresholds, recipients, or station configuration.
decomposes: SYS-SECURE-AUTHZ-001
end requirement

requirement ACCESS-STATION-001
title: Restrict station operations
statement:
  The gateway shall accept from a station only data and status operations assigned to that station identity.
decomposes: SYS-SECURE-AUTHZ-001
end requirement

requirement SYS-SECURE-AUDIT-001
title: Audit protected activity
statement:
  The service shall record protected interactions and make authorized audit history available for investigation.
decomposes: OPS-SECURE-001
end requirement

requirement AUDIT-WRITE-001
title: Write audit events
statement:
  The audit service shall append each protected interaction to tamper-evident storage.
decomposes: SYS-SECURE-AUDIT-001
end requirement

requirement AUDIT-QUERY-001
title: Query audit history
statement:
  The audit interface shall return protected-interaction records selected by time, actor, action, or target.
decomposes: SYS-SECURE-AUDIT-001
end requirement
